From 98a3d3decad3ceb33d56a706a8be035fc58669eb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 02:57:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Difficulty pass 4: Kanto wild Pokemon for the post-game

Every Kanto encounter level moves into a post-game band that keeps the
order of the areas: Route 1 is Lv. 46-48, Cerulean Cave 61-66, Mt.
Silver and Route 28 62-70. Wild Pokemon past a plain level-up evolution
appear evolved, except that the strongest lines stop at their middle
stage. Generated by tools/hack/kanto_wild.py.
---
